          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adoniya mwacitemacitema ŵajawile ku Tenti Jeswela ja AMBUJE, ni ŵajile kukamula songa sya ndumba sya malo gakupelecela mbopesi, ligongo ŵamjogwepe Mwenye Solomoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵandu ŵane ŵamsalile Mwenye Solomoni kuti, “Adoniya akwajogopa ŵalakwe mwenye, nipo ajile kukamula songa sya ndumba sya malo gakupelecela mbopesi. Akusala kuti, pandanda akusosa kuti ŵalakwe Mwenye Solomoni alumbile kuti ngamumwulaga Adoniyajo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomoni ŵajanjile kuti, “Naga jwalakwejo akuŵa jwakupikanila, ngatumtendela cakusakala cilicose, nambo naga akuŵa jwakusakala mtima, ni basi tawe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo Mwenye Solomoni ŵatumile ŵandu, kuja kumjigala Adoniya kumalo gakupelecela mbopesi kula. Adoniya piŵayice ŵajineme ni kumlambila Mwenye Solomoni. Mwenyejo ŵamsalile Adoniya kuti, “Mkadandawula, jawulagani kumangwenu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.53"
            ]
          }
        }
